@startuml architecture--ast-model-ir--class
' Document: ../../アーキテクチャ設計書.md
' Section: AST vs Model IR
' Purpose: ASTとModel IRが保持する情報（概念）

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK JP
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam LineColor #475569
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam componentBorderColor #64748B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam activityBorderColor #64748B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF7ED
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFBEA
skinparam noteBorderColor #D6C77A
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam classBorderColor #64748B
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam packageBorderColor #94A3B8

title ASTとModel IRが保持する情報（概念）

left to right direction
hide methods
class "AST" as ast <<構文表現>> {
  package declaration
  module declarations
  textual type references
  parameter expressions
}
class "Model IR" as ir <<正規化したモデル>> {
  resolved type names
  explicit Node definitions
  explicit Port definitions
  validated Connections
  resolved default ParameterSet
}
ast --> ir : 意味検証・正規化
note bottom of ir
  RuntimeはASTではなくModel IRを使う。
  具体的なRustの型定義を確定する図ではない。
end note
@enduml
